From f0a17509c83dc539b94f2d6f67d7127dceaede01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:54:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep curling frames complete and evenly paced
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Draw the HUD on every pass and capture nominal stone poses after each logic tick. Interpolate only draw positions, snap cuts, and preserve collision order and integer physics.

Choose a stable cadence during the intro, retain nominal 20 Hz tick deadlines, and reuse the tile streamer’s existing VRAM identities to avoid repeated synchronous window uploads.
